# The FreeCAD tree freecad.patch is rebased onto, and the only one it is known to apply
# to: a commit of FreeCAD main (2026-11-01). deps/src/freecad is gitignored, so nothing
# else in this repository records which upstream tree the port targets.
#
# patches/apply.sh reads this and refuses to patch a tree whose recorded commit
# (deps/src/freecad/.fcweb-freecad-commit, written by the fetch) is a different one,
# rather than fuzzily applying to the wrong source. A release tag (e.g. 1.1.3) is still
# accepted here; it is then checked against version.json / CMakeLists.txt as before.
